              ]
            },
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Hayyichi waan mesa fakaata, ka sibiila diimani mid'aasani, ka d'eerinnafi ballinni d'und'uma diddama, ka old'eerinni d'und'uma kud'ani mid'aase. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.4.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.4.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 4:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inni ammalle haro gingiti sibiila diimani mid'aasani jaare, ta ballinni afaani isii d'und'uma sodoma, ta qilumani isii d'und'uma shani ta d'eerinni jiddu isii d'und'uma kud'ani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.4.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.4.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 4:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Afaani haro suni, ka ala woini wolgubbati ch'ororsani barreesani. Woni barreesanini sunini waan aka akheekha koromi jira, ta isiifi haro suni sibiila taka iraa tumani mid'aasani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.4.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.4.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 4:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Haro suni koromi kud'ani lama, ta sibiila diimani mid'aasani gubba kayani; koromini sunini sadi sadiini moga moga gama gama fuula deefate ejaanjiti. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.4.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.4.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 4:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Furdinni sibiila haro sunini mid'aasani haguma ballinna gana harka namaati, afaani isiileeni aka daraara hooma qoqonyatani. Harooni suni bisaani d'ebbe haga kuma sadii fa fuuti. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.4.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.4.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 4:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EXO.30.17+EXO.30.18+EXO.30.19+EXO.30.20+EXO.30.21"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Bah 30.17-21",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Inni ammalle qori kud'ani mid'aase, shani moga bitaa ta Mana Waaqa kaye, shanile moga mirga kaye. Hujiini qori suni aka fooni hori gubani sorio baasani iti d'iqani. Ammo bisaani haro gingiti keesa jirani ka qaaloleeni d'iqattu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.4.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.4.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
